            "notes": "Checks the health and running status of the LUNs of a Huawei OceanStor Dorado storage system via the REST API (/lun endpoint). Alerts when a LUN reports a non-normal state, and optionally when a thin LUN fills up. Only LUNs mapped to a host are checked by default.",
